@startuml
!theme plain
actor "Institution Administrator" as Admin
participant "Unified Workspace" as Web
participant "Operations API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Durable Worker" as Worker
participant "Backup Executor" as Backup
collections "Tenant Object Versions" as S3
collections "Tenant Qdrant Points" as Qdrant
participant "Isolated Restore Drill" as Drill

Admin -> Web: Request tenant backup
Web -> API: POST /operations/backups
API -> DB: Create BackupRun + queued job
Worker -> DB: Claim job under tenant context
Worker -> Backup: Execute selected components
Backup -> DB: Export rows through forced tenant RLS
Backup -> S3: Export versions under tenants/{tenant_id}/
Backup -> Qdrant: Scroll points with mandatory tenant filter
Backup -> Backup: SHA-256 every file and manifest
Backup --> Worker: Location, component results, manifest digest
Worker -> DB: Complete run + immutable audit evidence

Admin -> Web: Request restore drill
Web -> API: POST /operations/backups/{id}/restore-drills
API -> DB: Create RestoreDrill + queued job
Worker -> Drill: Verify manifest and archive catalogue
alt approved isolated restore executable configured
  Drill -> Drill: Import tenant package and run institution-approved checks
  Drill --> Worker: isolated_restore_completed
else no executable configured
  Drill --> Worker: manifest_and_catalogue_validated
end
Worker -> DB: Store truthful validation result
@enduml
